<title>MALAYSIA: High-Low 1996 net profit up 32.7 pct.</title>
<headline>High-Low 1996 net profit up 32.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 158.94   vs	 119.77</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 26.3    vs	  19.8</p>
<p>    Turnover		   365.66   vs	 411.65</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   227.06   vs	 174.02</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	   13.94   vs	  37.40</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	15.0    vs	  14.5</p>
<p>    Special dividend (cents) 3.5    vs	   2.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysia's Highlands &amp; Lowlands Bhd is in plantations and property development.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
